  "id": "body-image-distortion",
  "term": "body-image distortion",
  "definition": "Body-image distortion is an inaccurate perception of one’s own body size or dimensions, such as seeing oneself as larger or smaller than one’s actual body. It is a form of body image misperception and can occur alongside dissatisfaction with body weight or shape.",
